# --- Bot runtime artifacts (generated by the running showcase bot) ---
# These are pure runtime output (AI analytics, rotated logs, research snapshots,
# crash dumps, session state). They bloat git and slow deploys with zero value in
# any cloud environment. Keep them on the host only. Real source .py files are
# NOT ignored — see exceptions below.
